<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts Georg Fisher.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts Georg Fisher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georg Fisher AG was rated &quot;buy&quot; as CS First Boston started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Analyst Andrea Snider said growth in the company would be driven by expansion in the U.S. and Asia.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
